        <h3 class="pe-statement-heading">
          Handmade Diagrams. Real Dimensions. No Guesswork. <mark class="pe-mark-yellow">No Regrets.</mark>
        </h3>

        <div class="pe-solution-card">
          <p class="pe-solution-lead">
            A home is the heart of your life—don't let one wrong decision turn your dream into daily frustration.
